                <invention-title lang="fr">CLASSIFICATION DE DÉFAUTS DANS DES SYSTÈMES D'ASCENSEUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">FAULT CLASSIFICATION IN ELEVATOR SYSTEMS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An elevator system (2) is provided which includes drive hardware for controlling the supply of power to one or more drive components (11). The elevator system (2) includes a safety chain (16) arranged to carry an electrical safety chain signal to an end of the conducting path (24). The elevator system (2) also includes a control device (12) arranged to receive safety chain information comprising a plurality of measurements of one or more properties of the electrical safety chain signal; identify a characteristic behaviour of one or more properties of the electrical safety chain signal using the plurality of measurements; and classify a fault in the elevator system (2) using the identified characteristic behaviour.</p>
